WEBVTT

00:00:04.700 --> 00:00:08.475
Open the app link in the browser of your phone or laptop.

00:00:08.475 --> 00:00:10.130
This is the sign in page.

00:00:10.130 --> 00:00:13.971
If this is your first time, tap, New tutor, Register here.

00:00:13.971 --> 00:00:15.495
You only register once.

00:00:16.295 --> 00:00:18.087
First, choose your district.

00:00:18.087 --> 00:00:22.439
Then type your full name, exactly as it appears in your appointment.

00:00:22.439 --> 00:00:27.815
The app uses your name and your school to recognize you if you ever forget your PIN.

00:00:28.615 --> 00:00:30.802
Next, choose your school from the list.

00:00:30.802 --> 00:00:37.084
If your school is not on the list, choose, My school is not on this list, and then type the name of your school.

00:00:37.884 --> 00:00:41.983
Now create a four digit PIN, and type it again to confirm.

00:00:41.983 --> 00:00:47.001
Choose a PIN you will remember, but do not use something easy to guess.

00:00:47.001 --> 00:00:51.949
Tick the box that says you will remember your PIN and your tutor code.

00:00:51.949 --> 00:00:54.140
Then tap, Register and sign in.

00:00:54.940 --> 00:00:56.445
This is your tutor code.

00:00:56.445 --> 00:00:59.392
Write it down on paper, together with your PIN.

00:00:59.392 --> 00:01:01.649
Do not keep them only on your phone.

00:01:01.649 --> 00:01:06.289
You will need both when you sign in on a new phone, or after you sign out.

00:01:07.089 --> 00:01:09.168
Tap, I wrote them down, Continue.

00:01:09.168 --> 00:01:10.868
You are now inside the app.

00:01:10.868 --> 00:01:15.214
The four tabs at the bottom are Learners, Today, Report, and Account.

00:01:15.214 --> 00:01:17.607
We will visit each one in this series.

00:01:18.407 --> 00:01:23.740
Next time, choose your district, type your tutor code and your PIN, and tap Sign in.

00:01:23.740 --> 00:01:28.122
Tick, Keep me signed in on this phone, only if the phone is your own.

00:01:28.122 --> 00:01:31.868
If you use a shared phone or a computer, leave it unticked.

00:01:32.668 --> 00:01:37.116
If you forget your code or your PIN, tap, Forgot my code or PIN.

00:01:37.116 --> 00:01:40.660
Type your full name and your school to get back in.

00:01:40.660 --> 00:01:44.273
You can also ask your district coordinator for help.
